{"1439040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Squingle", "steam_appid": 1439040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called ‘squingles.’ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ 100 LEVELS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching with 100 levels which will  grow in complexity, featuring tighter spaces and new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌈 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each maze is a stunning, morphing sculpture, offering an unmatched visual experience in Mixed Reality or Fully immersive modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 EASY TO PICK, HARD TO MASTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be accessible for both newcomers to VR and experts seeking a transcendent experience, with intuitive controls and hand tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😌 RELAX &amp; UNWIND</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on the sofa or in room-sized mazes. Squingle’s calming gameplay will soothe your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏅 AWARDS</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best VR Game ~ GDWC Finalist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finalist ~ QLDXR Festival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Best of the Quest” ~ Gibby’s Guide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode: Time trials and global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room/Mini scale: Play big or small!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your ghost: Beat your best times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called ‘squingles.’ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ 100 LEVELS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching with 100 levels which will  grow in complexity, featuring tighter spaces and new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌈 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each maze is a stunning, morphing sculpture, offering an unmatched visual experience in Mixed Reality or Fully immersive modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 EASY TO PICK, HARD TO MASTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be accessible for both newcomers to VR and experts seeking a transcendent experience, with intuitive controls and hand tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😌 RELAX &amp; UNWIND</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on the sofa or in room-sized mazes. Squingle’s calming gameplay will soothe your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏅 AWARDS</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best VR Game ~ GDWC Finalist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finalist ~ QLDXR Festival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Best of the Quest” ~ Gibby’s Guide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode: Time trials and global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room/Mini scale: Play big or small!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your ghost: Beat your best times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Squingle is the ultimate Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game. Navigate glass-like mazes called ‘Squingles,’ guiding orbs while avoiding edges and collecting points. Discover why it’s a critically acclaimed 5-star masterpiece!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“&quot;A Masterpiece.&quot;”<br><strong>93%</strong> – RuffTalkVR<br><br>““Brilliantly creative””<br>RoadToVR<br><br>“&quot;One of the most fascinating and original things ever seen in the world of video games.&quot;”<br><strong>9.1/10</strong> – VR Italia<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1439040/header.jpg?t=1737470647", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1439040/6b39a4f1ea12dd79273c54d1d86427b9bfca1c32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737470647", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1439040/6b39a4f1ea12dd79273c54d1d86427b9bfca1c32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737470647", "website": "https://www.squingle.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Proc